  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 804.01 Application, Data Required",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-07-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 804.01 Application, Data Required.\n\n(a) Any person applying for permission to connect an alarm shall furnish to the receiving agency the following:\n\n(1) The name, address, and telephone number of the subscriber;\n\n(2) The type of protection afforded by the alarm, whether burglary or fire;\n\n(3) The name, address, and telephone number of 2 persons to be called in the event of alarm activation;\n\n(4) Whether the alarm is monitored by any other person or agency, and if so, the name, address, and telephone number of same;\n\n(5) The name, address, and telephone number of the alarm service company;\n\n(6) The subscriber’s signature; and\n\n(7) The approving officer's signature.\n\n(b) The information above shall be provided on a form prescribed by the receiving agency. The department shall make available standardized application forms which the receiving agency may utilize.\n\nSource. #2282, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2791, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5068, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6457, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRES: 6-21-97; ss by #6474, eff 3-25-97; ss by #8307, INTERIM, eff 3-25-05, EXPIRES: 9-21-05; ss by #8392, eff 7-22-05; EXPIRED: 7-22-13\n\nNew. #12771, eff 5-2-19\n\nAPPENDIX",
